        "review_21": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>“I love Aaaroma fragrances! I can't tell the difference between expensive brand name perfumes and Aaaroma's perfumes in any way. I highly recommend that everyone stop spending a fortune on expensive brand name perfumes and instead get more for their money at Aaaroma. With Aaaroma's perfumes you can smell expensive and still stay within your budget! Love, love Aaaroma!❤️❤️❤️”</p>",
